{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13693","headline":"上古之什补亡训传十三章 · 顾况","name":"上古之什补亡训传十三章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"囝生闽方，闽吏得之。\n乃绝其阳，爲臧爲获。\n致金满屋，爲髠爲钳。\n如视草木，天道无知。\n我罹其毒，神道无知。\n彼受其福，郎罢别囝。\n吾悔生汝，及汝既生。\n人劝不举，不从人言。\n果获是苦，囝别郎罢。\n心催血下，隔地绝天。\n及至黄泉，不得在郎罢前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}